  "notes": "まとめる is often written in hiragana. Kanji: {纏|まと}める.\n\nTRANSITIVE/INTRANSITIVE:\n- まとめる (transitive): to put together\n- まとまる (intransitive): to come together, be settled\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {荷物|にもつ}をまとめる: to pack belongings\n- {意見|いけん}をまとめる: to consolidate opinions\n- {話|はなし}をまとめる: to settle a deal/talk\n- {考|かんが}えをまとめる: to organize thoughts\n- {髪|かみ}をまとめる: to tie up hair\n\nCOMMON NOUNS:\n- まとめ{買|が}い: bulk buying\n- まとめサイト: aggregation site\n- まとめ: summary (used in headlines)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {集|あつ}める: to gather, collect\n- {整理|せいり}する: to organize, sort",
